<report>
<title>Grouped linear regression</title>
<table>
<tr><th>Source of variation</th><th>SSq</th><th>DF</th><th>MSq</th><th>VR</th><th></th></tr>
<tr><td>Common slope</td><td>@{com_ssq:roundu}</td><td>@com_df</td><td>@{com_msq:roundu}</td><td>@{com_vr:roundu}</td><td><pval>@{com_p:pval}</pval></td></tr>
<tr><td>Between slopes</td><td>@{bet_ssq:roundu}</td><td>@bet_df</td><td>@{bet_msq:roundu}</td><td>@{bet_vr:roundu}</td><td><pval>@{bet_p:pval}</pval></td></tr>
<tr><td>Separate residuals</td><td>@{res_ssq:roundu}</td><td>@res_df</td><td>@{res_msq:roundu}</td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Within groups</td><td>@{grp_ssq:roundu}</td><td>@grp_df</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
</table>

<p>Common slope is <b>@com</b>significant<br />
Difference between slopes is <b>@diff</b>significant</p>

<p><i><b>Slope comparisons:</b></i></p>
<block name="slope">
<p><i>slope</i> @lab1 vs.<i> slope</i> @lab2 = @{res1:roundu} <i>vs.</i> @{res2:roundu}<br />
Difference<ci> (@{pc:round2}% CI) = </ci>@{dif:roundu}  <ci>(@{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu})</ci><br />
t = @{t:roundu} <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>

<p><i><b>Covariance analysis</b></i><br />
<b>Uncorrected:</b></p>
<table>
<tr><th>Source of variation</th><th>YY</th><th>xY</th><th>xx</th><th>DF</th></tr>
<tr><td>Between groups</td><td>@{uc_bet_yy:roundu}</td><td>@{uc_bet_xy:roundu}</td><td>@{uc_bet_xx:roundu}</td><td>@uc_bet_df</td></tr>
<tr><td>Within</td><td>@{uc_with_yy:roundu}</td><td>@{uc_with_xy:roundu}</td><td>@{uc_with_xx:roundu}</td><td>@uc_with_df</td></tr>
<tr><td>Total</td><td>@{uc_tot_yy:roundu}</td><td>@{uc_tot_xy:roundu}</td><td>@{uc_tot_xx:roundu}</td><td>@uc_tot_df</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>Corrected:</b></p>
<table>
<tr><th>Source of variation</th><th>SSq</th><th>DF</th><th>MSq</th><th>VR</th></tr>
<tr><td>Between groups</td><td>@{cr_bet_ssq:roundu}</td><td>@cr_bet_df</td><td>@{cr_bet_msq:roundu}</td><td>@{cr_bet_vr:roundu}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Within</td><td>@{cr_with_ssq:roundu}</td><td>@cr_with_df</td><td>@{cr_with_msq:roundu}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Total</td><td>@{cr_tot_ssq:roundu}</td><td>@cr_tot_df</td></tr>
</table>
<p><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>

<p><b>Corrected Y means + or - SE for baseline mean predictor of @{x_mean:roundu}:</b></p>
<table>
<block name="cmy">
<tr><td>Y' = @{y:roundu}</td><td>+ or - @{res:roundu}</td></tr>
</block>
</table>

<p><b>Line separations (common slope = @{slope:roundu}):</b><subtotal></subtotal></p>
<block name="notParallel">
<p>Lines not parallel</p>
</block>
<block name="sep">
<p><i>line</i> @lab1 vs.<i> line</i> @lab2 vertical separation = @{sep:roundu}<br />
<ci>@{pc:round2}% CI = @{fromSep:roundu} to @{toSep:roundu}</ci></p>
<table>
<tr><td>t = @{t:roundu}</td><td>(@{df:roundu} df)</td><td><pval>@{pSep:pval}</pval></td></tr>
</table>
</block>

<p>@{chart:chart}</p>

</report>
